  "lead": "Massachusetts state tax collections were <b>$11.62 billion</b> in the first quarter of 2026, +5.2% from the same quarter of 2025 (SRC-628-01). The United States (excluding D.C.) collected <b>$393.07 billion</b> (SRC-628-01). Individual income was the largest Massachusetts source after the total. Individual income taxes were <b>50.4%</b> of Massachusetts 2026 Q1 collections ($5.85 billion, SRC-628-01). On the annual Census STC file, Massachusetts collected <b>$41.34 billion</b> in FY 2023, rank 8 of 50 (derived, SRC-628-02). DOR monthly reports and tax credits remain pending.",
